awit lazy-human  [1] Issues [2] Graph [3] Queue  focus: list                                        
open: 6  archive: 0 (not loaded)   filters: no filter
HELP

1/2/3        switch tab (issues/graph/queue)
j/k, up/down move selection (list) / scroll (detail)
h/left       focus list
l/right      focus detail
tab          toggle focus list/detail
enter        focus detail
esc          back to list
/            search (issues)
o            toggle open/archive (issues)
c            close item
b            block item
u            unblock item
m            comment
space        claim (queue)
r            release (queue)
R            reload graph
P            external check on selection
V            validate report into detail
?            this help
q            quit

press ?/esc/q to close
warning: 1 items quarantined, run awit validate
1/2/3 tabs | j/k move | tab focus | / filter | o archive | c/b/u/m mutate | R reload | ? help | q quit